# STATUS: DIAMANT VGT SUPREME
# F-14 / CHAIN-016: fixed-argument privilege rules for the two AstraeaOS
# desktop helpers. Only the exact argument-less invocations are permitted; an
# attacker-controlled path (for example /etc/shadow via the path argument form) is not
# expressible through sudo because it is not covered by any rule here. The
# path argument form is reachable only through the polkit action, where the
# helper itself validates caller identity and file ownership on an open fd.
# Keep the empty "" argument-marker: sudo matches it against "no arguments".
%wheel ALL=(root) NOPASSWD: /usr/lib/astraeaos/gedefense-set-password ""
%wheel ALL=(root) NOPASSWD: /usr/lib/astraeaos/gedefense-ensure-ready ""
